# LF policy travelling with the repo (docs/OPERATIONS.md s3, REVIEW_360 s6):
# every text file is LF on every machine; only PowerShell launchers stay CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# binaries: never normalized, never diffed as text
*.npz binary
*.pkl binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.edf binary
